  "body": "Adds the notion of reporting and report-only mode to cross-origin opener policy.\n\n- [x] At least two implementers are interested (and none opposed):\n   * Chrome\n   * Firefox\n- [x] [Tests](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt) are written and can be reviewed and commented upon at:\n   * https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/tree/master/html/cross-origin-opener-policy/reporting\n- [ ] [Implementation bugs](https://github.com/whatwg/meta/blob/master/MAINTAINERS.md#handling-pull-requests) are filed:\n   * Chrome: [https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=1059303](https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=1059303)\n   * Firefox: …\n   * Safari: …\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5518/browsers.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 19, 2020, 9:30 PM UTC (c8265a7)\">/browsers.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5518/895fd80...c8265a7/browsers.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 19, 2020, 9:30 PM UTC (c8265a7)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5518/browsing-the-web.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 19, 2020, 9:30 PM UTC (c8265a7)\">/browsing-the-web.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5518/895fd80...c8265a7/browsing-the-web.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 19, 2020, 9:30 PM UTC (c8265a7)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5518/dom.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 19, 2020, 9:30 PM UTC (c8265a7)\">/dom.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5518/895fd80...c8265a7/dom.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 19, 2020, 9:30 PM UTC